<li>Rarity: Common ● Weight: 3 lbs. Description: A compact bow favored by hunters and scouts. Its smaller size allows for quick shots and easy transport. Technique: Rapidshot When you Disengage while wielding a shortbow, you may make one ranged weapon attack against a creature within 15 feet. This attack deals weapon damage without adding modifiers. Long Bow ● Slot: Weapon ● Type: Bow ● Training: Simple ● Grip: Double ● Reach: 150/600 ft. ● Damage: 1d8 plus your Dexterity modifier ● Damage Type: Piercing ● Properties: Ranged, Ammunition ● Cost: 10 Gold Pieces ● Rarity: Common ● Weight: 5 lbs. Description: A powerful bow capable of striking targets at great distances. Skilled archers can unleash deadly volleys from afar. Technique: Nock As a Bonus Action, you brace and draw an arrow with extra force. The next attack you make with a long bow before the end of your turn adds your Strength modifier to the damage roll. Martial Weapons Morningstar ● Slot: Weapon ● Type: Mace ● Training: Martial ● Grip: Dual ● Reach: 5 ft. ● Damage: 1d4 plus your Strength modifier ● Damage Type: Piercing ● Properties: Off-hand ● Cost: 12 Gold Pieces ● Rarity: Common ● Weight: 3 lbs. Description: A spiked steel head mounted on a sturdy haft, designed to punch through armor and inflict painful wounds with every strike.</li>
