<p>Technique: Imbue Fire Once per Long Rest, you may select any Fire spell that requires one Attunement slot and imbue it into this Wand. While you wield the weapon, you may cast that spell as though you were attuned to it. Sapphire Wand ● Slot: Weapon ● Type: Wand ● Training: Focus ● Grip: Single ● Reach: 40/160 ft. ● Damage: 1d6 plus your Intelligence modifier ● Damage Type: Ice ● Properties: Ranged ● Cost: 45 Gold Pieces ● Rarity: Uncommon ● Weight: 1 lb. Description: A smooth sapphire wand with a glassy finish, its core appearing frozen in suspended motion. Fine frost-like veining runs through its length. Technique: Imbue Ice Once per Long Rest, you may select any Ice spell that requires one Attunement slot and imbue it into this Wand. While you wield the weapon, you may cast that spell as though you were attuned to it. Topaz Wand ● Slot: Weapon ● Type: Wand ● Training: Focus ● Grip: Single ● Reach: 40/160 ft. ● Damage: 1d6 plus your Intelligence modifier ● Damage Type: Lightning ● Properties: Ranged ● Cost: 50 Gold Pieces ● Rarity: Uncommon ● Weight: 1 lb. Description: A gold wand segmented by angular topaz plates that catch light in sharp, metallic flashes. Tiny arcs occasionally dance between its facets. Technique: Imbue Lightning Once per Long Rest, you may select any Lightning spell that requires one Attunement slot and imbue it into this Wand. While you wield the weapon, you may cast that spell as though you were attuned to it. Citrine Wand ● Slot: Weapon ● Type: Wand ● Training: Focus</p>
